      47.85,
      381.97,
      539.93,
      426.04
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order imposein respect of the list of commodity specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, a Special Commodity Levy at the ratesspecified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      438.01,
      539.89,
      460.0
    ],
    "text": "This Order shall be valid until March 31, 2018 commencing from February 24, 2018, subject to provisions ofSub Section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      471.97,
      539.9,
      505.0
    ],
    "text": "The Order made under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007 and published in theExtraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2044/26 of 08.11.2017 in respect of Potatoes is rescinded with effect fromFebruary 24, 2018.",
